      "raw": "<p>Termi-Nation Absolute Zero, Termi-Nation Bunker, and Termi-Nation Unity vs. Chokepoint in Ft. Adamant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I Minted; it felt a little hairy at the beginning, but judicious application of a perpetually recycled Stealth Bot kept me from taking the worst blows. Once the board cleared up a bit and the game slowed down, I was able to get set up and did a pile of damage quickly, mostly from AZ and Unity. (Bunker's loaded-down Omni-Cannon sadly went toward knocking out Chokepoint's damage reduction. Ah well, should have been using it earlier.)&nbsp;&nbsp;Final HP 11 / 15 / 12.</p>",
