      "raw": "<p>I have never lost to Chokepoint. When I saw this set of heroes (some of my least favorite variants) and their opening hands (with practically no useful cards), I got worried. I got even more worried when the environment exploded with anti-hero cards and Chokepoint quickly beat all of my heroes down to less than 10hp.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But Unity finally got a modular workbench out and enough bots&nbsp;to start whomping. Chokepoint took our the enviroment herself. Absolute Zero drew the Impales and put them into play, shivering for more damage. Bunker kept accepting her shocking cards and then blowing up the equipment on his turn so they didn't do anything.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I did make some misplays along the way. I didn't use beebot correctly, for example. But in the end, it was Mint. 6/2/2.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Finally lose to Chokepoint?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Not today, Chokepoint. Not today.</p>",
