    {
      "id": 227356,
      "name": "starkenburg_alexander",
      "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-05-07T15:54:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint with 2/13/11. AZ was low because I just wanted to finish it rather than heal him back up from the Hoarfire.<br>\n<br>\nSimilar to bolnerap, redirecting the big hits to stealth bot, then cycling it back into play with Unity's base power saved quite a bit of damage. From there, I just plodded along as I could until I was at a point that I could start Shivering instead of just using Thermal Shockwave. The turn after I used Shivers, AZ went to town with a Hoarfire and blew up his Cryo-Chamber (nearly killing himself in the process) to do a pretty hefty chuck of Chokepoint to win the game.<br>\n<br>\nThough the starting environment did have me worried, Chokepoint took it all out for me after a few rounds, which was nice of her ;)<br>\n<br>\n~Komori</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:32.347Z",
