      "raw": "<p>Mint with 2/13/11. AZ was low because I just wanted to finish it rather than heal him back up from the Hoarfire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSimilar to bolnerap, redirecting the big hits to stealth bot, then cycling it back into play with Unity's base power saved quite a bit of damage. From there, I just plodded along as I could until I was at a point that I could start Shivering instead of just using Thermal Shockwave. The turn after I used Shivers, AZ went to town with a Hoarfire and blew up his Cryo-Chamber (nearly killing himself in the process) to do a pretty hefty chuck of Chokepoint to win the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThough the starting environment did have me worried, Chokepoint took it all out for me after a few rounds, which was nice of her ;)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n~Komori</p>",
      "actions_summary": [
