      "created_at": "2019-05-08T10:33:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint as well. Heroes went to single digits before AZ and Bunker started healing themselves and tanked for the rest of the game. With Ammo Drop out, Bunker hid in Turret Mode and then discarded his hand to nullify the environment by keeping the blast doors shut. After that, everyone, especially Unity, plunked away until ChokePoint went down. I never saw Stealth Bot, but Champion Bot, Platform Bots and Bee Bots did the job.</p>",
