    {
      "id": 227361,
      "name": "The Grim Digger",
      "username": "The_Grim_Digger",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/3e96dc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-05-10T02:00:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint at 0/2/3.&nbsp; I have never managed to get the hang of Termi-Nation AZ, especially when he doesn't have external sources of heat or cold to trigger from, so he was most useful destroying ongoings with his incap ability.&nbsp; Ironically, things really picked up when the remaining heroes were low enough to no longer have the highest health, so Chokepoint started attacking the bots instead.&nbsp; That coincided with a run of platforms and Mr. Chomps, and it went pretty quickly from that point.</p>",
